**Pilot Objective:** Progress starts with fun – Helping athletes grow by making enjoyment, team spirit, and well-being discussable.\
**Target Audience:** All types of athletes from age 12 and up.\
**Pilot Duration:** At least 6 months.\
**Web Application Access:** [https://sport-meter.nl/](https://sport-meter.nl/)

Glad you’re here! The Check-in Meter is specially developed for trainers and supervisors who want to take care of their team – not just physically, but also mentally. With SportMeter, you can easily check in with your athletes and quickly gain insight into how they’re really doing.

{% Video src="@/assets/works/mentale-kracht/infographic.mp4" /%}

### Why relevant now? 

We are receiving more and more practical questions to address the following challenge: "It is not so easy to properly monitor athletes’ help signals – especially in an environment with many athletes, limited coaching capacity, and changing team compositions."

